- Kālī in the Devī Māhātmya and later Goddess traditions.
- Kālī-centered Tantras and the history of Kālīkula.
- The twelve Kālīs and the Kashmirian Krama tradition.
- Kālī iconography in Bengal and other regions.
- Kālī Puja and modern devotional traditions.
